Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.68,0:31:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才正要打电话给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was actually just about to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.39,0:31:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我妹妹觉得我可能反应过度了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my sister thinks I'm probably overreacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.40,0:31:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不 很遗憾 你没有反应过度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, unfortunately, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.61,0:31:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思 发生了什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.74,0:31:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕你得来局里一趟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I need you to come down to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.25,0:31:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,萨曼莎 慢点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, slow down.
