Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.77,0:32:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是用他的号码打来的 -别接{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is coming - from his number. - Don't pick that up.
