Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.61,0:32:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-是谁  -你好啊 萨曼莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this? Hello, Samantha.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.95,0:32:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你想我吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.62,0:32:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我劝你先好好考虑再决定要不要骚扰我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to think long and hard about whether you really want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.62,0:32:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,因为之前骚扰我们的两个人都没命了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the last two people that fucked with us ended up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.62,0:32:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该感谢我 萨曼莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be thanking me, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.88,0:32:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,杰森和格雷格原本计划要杀你和你妹妹呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason and Greg were gonna kill you and your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.71,0:32:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我在他们下手前剖了他们的腹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gutted them before they had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.06,0:32:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢 你现在要保护我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what? You're protecting us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.98,0:33:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.39,0:33:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让全世界都看到你的真面目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to show the world who you really are:
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.94,0:33:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个骗子和杀人犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A liar and a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.94,0:33:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我要惩罚你 萨曼莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to punish you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.57,0:33:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你真不应该轻信网上的传言 浑蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't believe everything you read on the Internet, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.40,0:33:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,别嚣张 我会让你血债血偿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be cute. You're gonna pay for what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.91,0:33:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,在捅死你之前 我是不会停手的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm not gonna stop until I butcher you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.45,0:33:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你和挡道的人都得死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and anyone who gets between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.54,0:33:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你和塔拉最好当心身后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and Tara better watch your backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.75,0:33:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你才要当心身后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better watch yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.50,0:33:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.21,0:33:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.34,0:33:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.67,0:33:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Please! 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.38,0:33:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,到里面去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In there!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.64,0:33:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.85,0:33:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们刚才被袭击了 -快报警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We were just attacked. - Call 911!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.56,0:33:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都在排队呢 女士们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a fucking line here, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.19,0:33:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么事吗 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a problem here, guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.34,0:34:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-从后门出去 -谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go out the back! - Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.88,0:34:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-该死 锁住了 -钥匙 我们需要钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Fuck, it's locked. - Keys! We need your keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.10,0:34:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-当心 -小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look out! - Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.56,0:34:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.94,0:34:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait! No, no, no!
