Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.05,0:36:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-到后面看看 -后退 女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Going round back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.24,0:36:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在公寓案发现场的尸体旁 发现了这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was found next to the body at the apartment crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.33,0:36:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,DNA检测显示这是里奇基尔希的面具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DNA says that it belonged to someone named Richie Kirsch.
