Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.09,0:37:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但袭击我们的那个人戴的是另一个面具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the one that attacked us had a different mask on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.51,0:37:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那个面具更破旧 感觉使用的年头更长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was kind of more beat up. Like it was older.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.39,0:37:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我得问你们…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.68,0:37:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你们今晚早些时候有不在场证据吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you have alibis for earlier tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.93,0:37:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我和朋友参加了一个派对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was at a party with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.85,0:37:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我去见了心理治疗师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was at my therapist's.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.73,0:37:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以把他的联系信息给你 有需要的话你可以联系他核实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can give you his information. You can call to check if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.82,0:37:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我去那个派对找塔拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I met Tara at that party,
