Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.45,0:37:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,跟案子无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unrelated.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.12,0:37:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那是在这之前还是之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that before or after this happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.99,0:37:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-杀人凶手 -你有什么毛病 贱人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderer! What the fuck is wrong with you, bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.79,0:37:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我有意见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a problem with me? 
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.25,0:37:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.16,0:37:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,重点是 我们整晚都跟别人在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The point is, we were with people all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.54,0:37:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们室友的爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, our roommate's dad
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.54,0:37:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然恰巧负责我们的案子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just happened to pull our case.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.63,0:37:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-这真是个不可思议的巧合 对吧  -对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That'd be a crazy coincidence, right? - Yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.13,0:37:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,负责这个案子的警探把案件交给了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The detective who had the case, he offered it to me 
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.76,0:37:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这牵扯到奎茵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because it involves Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.18,0:37:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你们反感的话 我完全可以交回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, but I can totally give it back if you're uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.93,0:37:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,看你们的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.02,0:37:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.98,0:37:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,所以如果袭击你的人确实偷了你的证件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if the man who attacked you did steal your license
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.53,0:38:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,并故意放在尸体旁边…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and plant it next to the body,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.24,0:38:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那么对方可能是你们亲近的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it'd probably be somebody close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.61,0:38:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你们跟朋友认识多久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have you known your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.53,0:38:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大概六个月之前 我们和明迪 查德一起搬来上暑期课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we moved here with Mindy and Chad for summer semester, like, six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.16,0:38:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,奎茵 伊森和安妮卡都是那时候认识的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Quinn, um, Ethan, Anika-- all since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.63,0:38:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以为奎茵的为人打包票 所以可以排除一个嫌疑人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I can vouch for Quinn, so that's one less we have to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.50,0:38:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩有认识 可能会以你们为攻击目标的人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do either of you have anyone that might want to target you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.97,0:38:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,认识的已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anyone who's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.97,0:38:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.72,0:38:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,FBI的人来了 要争夺管辖权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}FBI's here, claiming jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.14,0:38:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.65,0:38:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么可以帮忙的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.70,0:38:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我是FBI探员可碧里德 来自亚特兰大办事处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Special Agent Kirby Reed, FBI. I work out of the Atlanta office.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.74,0:38:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 你是迷路了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. You lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.62,0:38:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你的两个受害人来纽约上大学前 是我们市的居民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your two vics were residents of my city before they moved here for college.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.00,0:38:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我前几个月一直在调查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been investigating their online activity
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.12,0:38:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的网络活动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the past few months.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.75,0:39:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.96,0:39:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.13,0:39:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我对鬼面袭击案特别感兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take a special interest in Ghostface attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.22,0:39:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-可碧  -嘿 萨曼莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kirby? - Hey, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.30,0:39:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.01,0:39:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,塔拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.89,0:39:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是那个FBI探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.85,0:39:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-你们认识  -对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You guys know each other? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.39,0:39:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是伍德小镇高中的校友 我读高一时她在毕业班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We went to Woodsboro High together. She was a senior when I was a freshman.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.81,0:39:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我们有相同的经历{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We share a certain history, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.78,0:39:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是来抢管辖权的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not trying to get into a jurisdictional pissing contest here,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.15,0:39:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想提供协助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.03,0:39:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,给你看我收集的信息 希望你也礼尚往来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you mine, et cetera.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.24,0:39:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.54,0:39:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,袭击者把面具留在了那家杂货店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left this mask at the bodega.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.62,0:39:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们检测到两个人的DNA{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DNA traces of two individuals,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.33,0:39:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,查理沃克和吉尔罗伯茨 两人都已不在人世{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie Walker, Jill Roberts, both deceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.96,0:39:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是2011年的鬼面杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ghostface killers of 2011.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.84,0:39:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是查理沃克的手笔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie Walker gave me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.68,0:39:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过 我对这些案件特别感兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, I take a special interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.43,0:39:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人袭击你们时 是戴着这个面具吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this the mask he was wearing when he attacked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.93,0:39:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.52,0:39:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,所以对方是故意把面具留在现场的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he's leaving them on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.27,0:40:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这表明做这件事的人 是以前那些凶手的追随者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means whoever's doing this is a student of the killers who came before.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.02,0:40:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也许那个人认为萨曼莎是最新的鬼面杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he believes Sam is the latest in a long line.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.44,0:40:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 祝你们查得顺利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, good luck with that. 
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.78,0:40:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要出城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.07,0:40:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾 不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, that's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.57,0:40:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩是两起杀人案的嫌疑人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're both persons of interest in a double homicide,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.37,0:40:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你们不准出城 很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you're not allowed to leave town. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.41,0:40:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-你开玩笑吗  -他说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you serious? - He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.04,0:40:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-但如果我们携手合作… -我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if we work together--We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.80,0:40:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她们出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming out

.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.51,0:40:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,萨曼莎 对于昨晚的凶杀案 你有不在场证明吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Samantha, do you have an alibi for last night's murders?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.47,0:40:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,塔拉 你在你姐姐身边有安全感吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tara, do you feel safe around your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.51,0:40:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,塔拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tara! Tara!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.72,0:40:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是四频道的盖尔威瑟斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gale Weathers, Channel 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.56,0:40:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你们觉得是你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you ladies think you're the reason
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.10,0:40:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,把鬼面杀手引来纽约的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Ghostface killer has come to the Big Apple?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.36,0:40:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,身手不错 亲爱的 但这种场面我见多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice try, sweetie, but I've done this dance before.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.70,0:40:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-离我们远点 -萨曼莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay away from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.07,0:40:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还生我的气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you still mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.70,0:40:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过不会把发生的事写成书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you wouldn't write a book about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.50,0:41:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,结果你却言而无信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you wrote a book about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.16,0:41:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.25,0:41:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,总会有人写的 这是我的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody was gonna write about it! It's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.21,0:41:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你的电影版权没卖出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard you couldn't sell the movie rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.50,0:41:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,现在流行的是真实犯罪迷你剧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all about true-crime limited series these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.67,0:41:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起经历了那么多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After everything we went through together.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.43,0:41:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,杜威会怎么想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would Dewey think?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.93,0:41:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-这招真卑鄙 -你的书也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's a low blow. - So was your book.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.47,0:41:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你说我“精神不稳定” 是“天生的杀手”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You called me "unstable" and a "born killer."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.23,0:41:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是断章取义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's taken out of context.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.31,0:41:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我这是直接引用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's literally a quote.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.52,0:41:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你不觉得你写的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think what you wrote has something 
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.57,0:41:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我们这次的遭遇有关系吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to do with what's happening to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.19,0:41:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.19,0:41:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我跟西德尼聊过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I talked to Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.20,0:41:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-她不会来纽约 对吗  -不会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-She's not coming here, is she? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.53,0:41:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她要我代她问好 但她要带马克和孩子们去安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She sends her love, but she's taking Mark and the kids someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.37,0:41:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她值得有一个圆满的结局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She deserves to have her happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.54,0:41:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点我们同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On that much, we agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.30,0:41:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我跟你们一样想要抓到那个浑蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I want to catch this fucker as much as you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.09,0:41:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.05,0:41:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你真正担心的是 如果没了鬼面的素材{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe you're just afraid that without Ghostface in your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.39,0:41:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你会名气大跌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna fade away.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.23,0:42:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些白痴 你们有危险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fools! You're in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.48,0:42:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没看到吗 它们在追你们 在追我们所有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you see? They're after you! They're after all of us! 
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.90,0:42:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的妻子 儿女 每一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our wives, our children, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.32,0:42:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经来了 你们就是下一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're here already! You're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.57,0:42:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就是下一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're next! You're next! You're next! You're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.67,0:42:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.52,0:42:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,明天才玩“不给糖就捣蛋”的游戏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a day early for trick-or-treating, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.01,0:43:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,（卡彭特 萨曼莎）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.95,0:43:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.47,0:43:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.48,0:43:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 书呆子们 听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, nerds, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.45,0:43:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然这次的鬼面杀人案很可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As terrifying as this all is,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.32,0:43:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但我很高兴能有机会扳回一局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm actually glad I get a chance to redeem myself
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.57,0:43:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,上一次我猜错了凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for not calling the killers last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.74,0:43:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-对 -没关系 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yep. - It's fine. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.00,0:43:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,依我看 有人是想把续集变成重续片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way I see it, someone is out to make a sequel to the requel.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.33,0:43:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什么是重续片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, what's a requel?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.04,0:43:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你很漂亮 亲爱的 但等我说完再提问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're beautiful, sweetie. Let's hold questions to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.59,0:43:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,《血腥刺杀1》发生在伍德小镇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stab 1 took place in Woodsboro.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.13,0:43:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,《血腥刺杀2》发生在大学里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stab 2 took place in college.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.47,0:44:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们推测凶手要模仿这些电影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we think that the killer is trying to copy the movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.85,0:44:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有这个可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is one possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.43,0:44:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,主角在大学里 对上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heroes now in college: Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.64,0:44:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,人物中增加了可疑的新角色 让嫌疑人和/或受害者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suspicious new characters brought in to round out the suspect list and/or body count: 
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.56,0:44:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,在数量上更丰富{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check, check and check. 
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.65,0:44:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-你们几个都对上了 -我不喜欢这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.81,0:44:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-但这不可能是《血腥刺杀2》的重演 -为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But it can't just be about Stab 2. - Why not? 
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.32,0:44:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这是续集 这还说得通{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would make sense if this were just a sequel.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.11,0:44:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们不是在续集里 因为现在已经没人拍续集了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're not in a sequel, because nobody just makes sequels anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.20,0:44:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是在电影系列里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in a franchise!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.87,0:44:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一个连贯的电影系列 需要遵守一定的规则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there are certain rules to a continuing franchise.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.46,0:44:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-我就知道你会说这些 -第一条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I had a feeling. - Rule one:
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.58,0:44:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,各方面的规模都超过以往{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is bigger than last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.29,0:44:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,更多预算 更多角色 更多受害者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bigger budget, bigger cast, bigger body count.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.30,0:44:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,更长的追逐 还有枪战和砍头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Longer chases, shoot-outs, beheadings.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.17,0:44:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你得超越以往才能吸引人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to top what came before to keep people coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.26,0:44:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-砍头  -砍头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Beheadings? - Beheadings.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.30,0:44:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,第二条：不管上一次是什么剧情 这次都反着来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rule two: Whatever happened last time, expect the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.85,0:44:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,系列电影只有颠覆预期才能生存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Franchises only survive by subverting expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.89,0:44:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果之前的凶手 是喜欢抱怨和过分敏感的电影迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the killers last time were whiny snowflake film nerds
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.06,0:44:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有多个影评网站账号 却没有个性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with Letterboxd accounts instead of personalities,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.15,0:44:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那么这次你们可以反着猜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can bet the opposite will be true here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.15,0:44:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,第三条：谁都没有安全牌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And rule three: No one is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.65,0:45:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,之前参演过的角色在新剧集里都是炮灰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legacy characters? Cannon fodder at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.32,0:45:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,之所以让他们在新剧集里露脸 就是为了在怀旧时轻松干掉他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Usually brought back only to be killed off in some cheap bid for nostalgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.62,0:45:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,所以盖尔和可碧有危险哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not looking too good for Gale and Kirby.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.33,0:45:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这还不是最糟糕的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and that's not even the worst part!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.50,0:45:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这时候她会跟我们说最糟糕的部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the part where she tells us the worst part.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.67,0:45:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,最糟糕的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The worst part is
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.25,0:45:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,系列电影 只是给电影IP持续加热的分集影片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}franchises are just continuing episodic installments designed to boost an IP.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.42,0:45:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这意味着在新剧集里 主角也完全可以舍弃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means main characters are completely expendable now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.97,0:45:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,比如劳瑞斯特罗德 南希汤普森 艾伦雷普利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laurie Strode, Nancy Thompson, Ellen Ripley,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.43,0:45:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,莎莉哈德斯蒂 电锯人 托尼史塔克 詹姆斯邦德…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sally Hardesty, Jigsaw, Tony Stark, James Bond--
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.35,0:45:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,连卢克天行者也一样 他们都死了 这样系列电影才能接着拍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, even Luke Skywalker-- all died so their franchises could live on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.19,0:45:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这意味着有危险的 不仅仅是好友团里的伙伴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means it's not just the friend group.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.32,0:45:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们任何人都可能随时被杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any of us could go at any time,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.95,0:45:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是萨曼莎和塔拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}especially Sam and Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.66,0:45:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等 任何人  -对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, any of us? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.08,0:45:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-我在这个好友团里  -对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I in the friend group? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.87,0:45:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我是目标之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I, like, one of the targets?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.54,0:45:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我会不会死了都还是处男{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I gonna die a virgin?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.88,0:45:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你透露的信息让人有点尴尬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a weird overshare.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.51,0:46:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但让我们来看看目前的嫌疑人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it brings us to our current suspects:
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.30,0:46:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.38,0:46:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会怀疑这个呆里呆气的腼腆男生 因为他太呆和腼腆了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shy, dorky guy who no one suspects because he's so shy and dorky.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.10,0:46:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么会在嫌疑人名单里 就因为我无意中成了查德的舍友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why am I on the suspect list? Because I'm randomly Chad's roommate?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.18,0:46:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,抽签选室友是可以作假的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roommate lotteries can be juked.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.10,0:46:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能为了接近我们而动了手脚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have fixed it to get next to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.35,0:46:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,奎茵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.61,0:46:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,风流的室友 这简直是恐怖电影的经典角色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The slutty roommate. A horror movie... ...classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.86,0:46:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是“性积极” 但谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Sex positive," but... thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.90,0:46:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么成为萨曼莎和塔拉的室友的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, how did you come to live with Sam and Tara?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.86,0:46:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我回应了她们的在线招室友广告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I answered their ad online.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.16,0:46:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 别再说了 你的回答已经够可疑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, say no more. You've already implicated yourself enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.62,0:46:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个匿名广告 明迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an anonymous ad, Mindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.37,0:46:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道 我们调查过她 而且她的爸爸还是警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know we vetted her. Plus her dad is a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.71,0:46:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这让她更有可能是凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that makes it more likely that she's the killer,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.67,0:46:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有个警察爸爸是绝妙的掩护{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because having a cop dad is a great cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.38,0:46:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你不记得 恐怖电影是怎么演的了吗 塔拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you not remember how these movies work, Tara?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.46,0:46:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直这样吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.30,0:46:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,最后是安妮卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And finally... Anika.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.85,0:46:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,永远不要相信恋爱角色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never trust the love interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.35,0:46:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们弄懂了规则 也列出了嫌疑人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay! So, we have our rules and we have our suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.69,0:46:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 那你们呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But wait. What about you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.98,0:47:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们可以放心地排除我们四个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I think it's pretty safe to rule out the four of us
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.86,0:47:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去年在伍德小镇经历过这种事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who went through this last year in Woodsboro.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.28,0:47:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-同意 -不同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Agreed. - Um, not agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.36,0:47:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,万一你们受到的创伤 导致你们中的一个或几个人发疯呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if the trauma you all went through caused one or more of you to snap?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.62,0:47:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对 或者你们从那些杀人事件中 获得的名气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, or the fame you got from the killings made you thirsty for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.08,0:47:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,让你们渴望更加出名呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, let's be honest here,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.62,0:47:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说 网上关于萨曼莎的一些推论…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some of the theories online about Sam are--
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.67,0:47:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢胡说试试看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you fucking dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.88,0:47:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 但她说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, she's right, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.13,0:47:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们面对事实吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, face facts--
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.22,0:47:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们都有嫌疑 那你们也有嫌疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we're all suspects, you're all suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.31,0:47:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,记得萨曼莎卡彭特的不在场证明吗  那个心理治疗师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember Samantha Carpenter's alibi, the therapist?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.61,0:47:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他被捅死了 从鼻子捅死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was stabbed to death. Through the nose. 
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.03,0:47:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,从鼻子捅死的 这得多癫狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through the nose. How messed up is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.53,0:47:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是很癫狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pretty messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.12,0:47:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他听了萨曼莎的危险言论后举报了她 结果却死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He turned her in for making threatening remarks, ended up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.95,0:47:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你猜猜哪个病人的就医记录被偷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And guess which patient's notes were stolen?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.62,0:48:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以萨曼莎杀了自己的不在场证人 还偷了自己的记录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Sam kills her own alibi and steals her own session notes?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.04,0:48:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.30,0:48:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,在现场又发现了一个面具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another mask was found at the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.71,0:48:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,DNA跟罗曼布里格的匹配{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a DNA match for Roman Bridger.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.01,0:48:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,执导《血腥刺杀3》的鬼面杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ghostface who was directing Stab 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.89,0:48:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉他在给我们留真实的电影彩蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like he's leaving us real-life franchise Easter eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.10,0:48:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,以倒序的方式留下面具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like dropping the killers' masks in reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.31,0:48:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉杀手在进行某种倒数{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost like he's counting down to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.48,0:48:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,倒数到《血腥刺杀1》会发生什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens when he gets to one?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.11,0:48:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,目前我们一共有九名鬼面杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we've had nine Ghostface killers so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.20,0:48:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,九名 但是在电影里…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine. I thought in the movies--
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.66,0:48:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别纠结电影了 电影不重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget about the movies. The movies don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.70,0:48:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看 去年是安波弗里曼和里奇基尔希{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. Last year was Amber Freeman and Richie Kirsch,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.79,0:48:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在第一个案发现场发现了他们的面具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose masks we found at the first crime scene
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.75,0:48:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就在两名电影学生的尸体旁边 而在那晚的早些时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}along with the bodies of two film students
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.34,0:48:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这学生杀害了他们的教授{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who killed their professor earlier that same night.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.96,0:48:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,然后是吉尔罗伯茨和查理沃克 他们的面具被留在杂货店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it was Jill Roberts and Charlie Walker-- theirs at the bodega.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.34,0:48:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,罗曼布里格是唯一单独作案的鬼面杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roman Bridger was the only single Ghostface.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.01,0:48:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,表扬一下他的远大志向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kudos to him for ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.47,0:48:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他的面具出现在心理医生的家里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His mask was found at the shrink's.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.85,0:49:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来就剩米奇阿尔蒂里 南希卢米斯 斯图马赫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which leaves Mickey Altieri, Nancy Loomis, Stu Macher...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.52,0:49:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还有比利卢米斯 第一个鬼面杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and Billy Loomis. Number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.98,0:49:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他也是头号嫌疑人的生父{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the father of our chief suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.53,0:49:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,做这件事的人要把我们再次引向萨曼莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, whoever's doing this is leading us back to Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.58,0:49:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我稍后再跟你谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will check in later.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.16,0:49:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,让你女儿小心点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And tell your daughter to stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.29,0:49:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,接近卡彭特姐妹就是接近鬼面杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proximity to the Carpenters is proximity to Ghostface.
