Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.52,1:02:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.19,1:03:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好 好吧 我不会公开报道 行吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, fine. Off the record, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.90,1:03:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,行 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.04,1:03:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉我打了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I punched you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.75,1:03:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你没打{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.16,1:03:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我是没打{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.38,1:03:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你是警察 对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the cop, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.42,1:03:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我调查了你的前两个受害者 然后有了新发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did some digging on your first two victims and I found something.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.63,1:03:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道面具是从哪里来的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know where the masks are coming from.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.18,1:03:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,带我去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.64,1:03:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.60,1:03:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可碧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirby?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.60,1:03:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,盖尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gale.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.68,1:03:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-她是FBI探员 -她就是个小年轻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's with the FBI.She's a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.02,1:03:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,FBI什么时候招儿童了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did they start letting children into the FBI?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.90,1:03:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-我30岁了 -但你看起来就像个受精卵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm 30. - Well, you look like a zygote.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.27,1:03:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我配有枪 盖尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a gun, Gale.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.57,1:03:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你肯定也想看那个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, fine. You're gonna want to see this, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.57,1:03:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,杰森和格雷格是亚特兰大的富家子弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason and Greg were little Atlanta rich boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.78,1:03:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很明显 他们用假名租了这个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, they used fake names to rent this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.54,1:03:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么发现的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.29,1:03:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,新闻里有一种报道叫“调查报道” 是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called "investigative journalism" for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.50,1:03:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么没查出来  你不是在追踪他们吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How didn't you find it? Weren't you tracking them?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.96,1:04:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我多次查过他们的财务记录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went through their financial records dozens of times.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.92,1:04:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方没在那些记录里 这说不通{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was not in any of them. Doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.92,1:04:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 是我的调查水平高 你也会有这一天的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. I'm just really good at my job. You'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.32,1:04:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方 安保人员在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place? What's with all the security?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.62,1:04:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个电影院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a movie theater.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.58,1:04:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不仅仅是电影院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not just a theater.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.87,1:04:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,还是一个圣殿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shrine.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.40,1:05:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他们收集了整个系列的物品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got the whole goddamn franchise.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.88,1:05:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,（布拉德利音像出租店 加州 伍德小镇）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.26,1:05:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,查德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chad?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.51,1:05:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这是兰迪舅舅的物品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was Uncle Randy's.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.09,1:05:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都集齐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.72,1:05:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-那是… -捅我的那把刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that--The knife I was stabbed with.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.10,1:05:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都经历太多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all have been through so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.44,1:05:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是谁画的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who drew all these?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.69,1:05:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,（《伍德小镇凶案》《校园惊云》《末日之刃》）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.49,1:05:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,（杜威莱利）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.87,1:05:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,杜威{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.50,1:06:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是怎么弄到这些的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how'd they get all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.25,1:06:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这些不是物证吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this evidence?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.67,1:06:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,警察爱钱 而谎称证物丢失简直是小菜一碟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, cops like money, and evidence can get lost pretty easily.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.59,1:06:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,当然不包括在场的两位警官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Present company excluded, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.80,1:06:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要来这里  我的不在场证明得到了证实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, why am I here exactly? My alibi checks out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.52,1:06:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为了能让我盯着你 室友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I can keep an eye on you, roomie.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.23,1:06:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手在杀害杰森和格雷格之前 一定已经发现了这个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The killer must have found this place before he murdered Jason and Greg.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.61,1:06:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他将模特上的面具摘下来带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then he took the masks off the mannequins.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.73,1:06:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,九个全带走了 从斯图到比利 再到安波和里奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All nine, from Stu and Billy to Amber and Richie.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.97,1:06:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,（比利）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.60,1:07:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 这地方真酷啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hot damn! How fucking cool is this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.89,1:07:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,才不酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.31,1:07:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就是很酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.02,1:07:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,得了 萨曼莎 你一定很高兴 能一起继续我们的事业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Sam, you got to be excited to get our murder on again. Together.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.27,1:07:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,比利和萨曼莎 卢米斯小队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy and Sam. Team Loomis.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.99,1:07:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好再杀更多烂人吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get ready to slice up more motherfuckers.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.25,1:07:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.34,1:07:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.14,1:07:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,所以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.93,1:07:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有人杀了那两个蠢人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somebody killed these chucklefucks
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.64,1:07:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,然后接手了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and took over?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.02,1:07:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人相信伍德小镇的命案 是萨曼莎主使的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone who believes that Sam masterminded Woodsboro.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.69,1:07:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这是普通的《血腥刺杀》 这会是杀手的幌子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this were a normal Stab movie, this would be the killer's lair.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.48,1:07:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这意味着这不是普通的《血腥刺杀》{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means this isn't a normal Stab movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.79,1:08:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是砸死斯图马赫的电视{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The TV that killed Stu Macher.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.67,1:08:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,前提是你相信他真的死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you believe he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.42,1:08:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说你是个恐怖电影迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear you're a horror fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.09,1:08:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been said. 
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.93,1:08:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,拍得最好的《猛鬼街》是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best Nightmare on Elm Street?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.93,1:08:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,第一部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The original.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.52,1:08:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,最好的《十三号星期五》是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best Friday the 13th?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.39,1:08:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-第二部 -终结篇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Part II.The Final Chapter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.40,1:08:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我一度很喜欢科里费尔德曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had a crush on Corey Feldman.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.86,1:08:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 理解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.82,1:08:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,《惊魂记2》{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Psycho II is...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.90,1:08:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-被低估了 -被低估了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...underrated.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.24,1:08:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,《糖果人》 是原版好还是重续版好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Candyman. The original or requel?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.24,1:08:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-都好 -都好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.66,1:08:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. 
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.91,1:08:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还算有两下子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game recognize game.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.71,1:08:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.97,1:09:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,萨曼莎 我什么时候才能重新当个普通人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, when do I get to be a normal person again?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.35,1:09:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.93,1:09:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想卷进这种事里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to be a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.89,1:09:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想牵扯什么愚蠢的往事 就因为我…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to be a part of some stupid legacy because I'm--
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.27,1:09:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,全都怪我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.11,1:09:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.36,1:09:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了 萨曼莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just drop it, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.45,1:09:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,塔拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.37,1:09:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我去找她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got her.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.33,1:09:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来气氛很严肃啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That seemed intense.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.21,1:09:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,自从我重新走进她的生活后 我就…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since I came back into her life, I've just...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.67,1:09:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,搞得一团糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}made a mess of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.67,1:09:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.76,1:09:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在这些事里 你妈妈人呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your mother in all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.05,1:09:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟塔拉说了比利的事后 她就不理我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She cut me off when I told Tara about Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.01,1:09:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然后塔拉也不理她 因为她不愿意跟我说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then Tara cut her off because she wouldn't talk to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.18,1:09:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以现在我们都没有妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so now neither of us have a mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.56,1:09:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉要这样说 但她真差劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to say this, but fuck her.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.73,1:09:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我的父母也很差劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My parents sucked, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.99,1:09:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但你仍然可以组建自己的家庭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can still make your own family.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.86,1:10:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,即使你只有一个家人也可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if it's just with one person.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.87,1:10:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你连这个家人也失去了呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you lose that one person?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.29,1:10:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那就继续好好生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just-- You keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.17,1:10:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你会找到另一个孤独者 然后你们彼此照应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And maybe you find another loner, and you look after each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.05,1:10:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么走出那段阴影的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you get past what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.44,1:10:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我被捅了之后 差点就死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost died after I was stabbed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.19,1:10:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,严格来说 我确实死过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technically, I did die.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.78,1:10:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,死过四分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.41,1:10:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,当我康复后…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I recovered...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.41,1:10:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我很恼火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.33,1:10:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想余生都活在对恶人的恐惧里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want to spend the rest of my life being afraid of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.25,1:10:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让那些恶人恐惧我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted the monsters to be afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.04,1:10:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这态度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.34,1:11:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉打断你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.72,1:11:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能想到了一个 让那个变态碰壁的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think I might have an idea about how to turn the tables on this creep.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.97,1:11:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 我们加入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. We're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.68,1:11:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 盖尔 媒体人不得参与{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Gale. No press allowed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.72,1:11:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这是警方的事务 我做本职工作也很出色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police business. I'm good at my job, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.77,1:11:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该跟他们在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have stayed with the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.90,1:11:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.78,1:11:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,让两个人都陷入险境没有意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no point in both of us putting ourselves at risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.74,1:11:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是陷入险境 我是当你的后盾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not. I'm your backup.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.75,1:11:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在做电影里从不管用的电话跟踪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're really doing the phone tracing thing that never works in the movies.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.75,1:11:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你会说：“继续跟他通话 萨曼莎 再说两分钟 我就快锁定他了”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be all, "Keep him talking, Sam. Two more minutes, I've almost got him."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.92,1:11:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,然后那个人 在我们马上就能锁定位置时挂了电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then he hangs up just before we can get a lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.59,1:11:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以在15秒内锁定位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can trace a call in under 15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.43,1:11:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你让她们在外面当诱饵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you've got them out there as bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.51,1:11:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,因为凶手通常都在诱饵的附近打电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the killer usually calls from somewhere nearby.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.68,1:11:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得现在是白天 这里是公共场所 所以她们很安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you think they're safe because it's broad daylight in a public place?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.06,1:11:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有我在呢 好吗 贝利也在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I am here, okay? And so is Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.48,1:12:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的兰迪舅舅就是这么死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is exactly how our Uncle Randy died.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.19,1:12:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在大白天的公共场合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Broad daylight. Public place.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.99,1:12:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,被拖进一辆小货车里 然后被狂捅数刀 兰迪就这么没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yanked into a van. Stab, stab, stab. No more Randy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.83,1:12:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,萨曼莎 在外面不必紧张 好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Sam? Stay frosty out there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.12,1:12:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're good.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.55,1:12:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,（来电 里奇基尔希）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.94,1:12:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-你死定了 -不 是你死定了 萨曼莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna die, you know. No, you're gonna die, Samantha!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.32,1:12:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在我砍你妹妹的时候被自己的血呛死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Choking on your own blood while I hack up your sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.28,1:12:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定我们会先找到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless we find you first.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.70,1:12:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,作为主使 你真的不太聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a mastermind, you're not very bright.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.91,1:12:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你想等我打电话给你 祈祷我就在附近 这样警察就能抓我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiting for me to call, desperately hoping I'm nearby so the police can grab me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.25,1:13:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不在附近 我先你一步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm not nearby. I'm a step ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.96,1:13:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 萨曼莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be seeing you, Samantha.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.18,1:13:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,锁定位置了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.13,1:13:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,锁定了 定位马上显示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep. Geolocation coming through right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.43,1:13:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,（已定位）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.39,1:13:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他在上西城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on the Upper West Side.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.97,1:13:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他在城市另一头的公寓大楼里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's inside an apartment building, halfway across the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.31,1:13:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-是西96街吗  -你怎么知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- On West 96th? - How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.57,1:13:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,盖尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gale.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.70,1:13:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,“媒体人不得参与‘’{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"No press."
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.78,1:13:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,臭丫头 我上次见你时 你的毛还没长齐呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch, last time I saw you, you were in glee club.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.62,1:13:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅 我不信你能保障她们的安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me if I don't trust you to keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.08,1:13:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-给你 宝贝 -谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here you go, baby. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.54,1:13:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友丹尼在上西城工作 他可以更快赶到那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend Danny works on the Upper West Side. He can get there quicker.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.46,1:13:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但他也可能会干掉她 他有可能是凶手吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, or he could finish her off. Is it possible he's the killer?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.50,1:13:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 我们得尽快赶过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck. We have to get there now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.26,1:13:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那里隔着50个街区 而且我们不知道 信息是否准确 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's 50 blocks away. We don't even know if it's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.55,1:13:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-你花时间想想 -我们没时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam, wait! Take a minute. - We don't have a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.22,1:13:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你得相信我 我们得做正确的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to trust me, we got to make the right call.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.18,1:13:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-他已经… -萨曼莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's already-- Sam!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.43,1:13:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,上车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.56,1:13:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她在干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.81,1:13:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 从我的车上下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, get out of my car!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.48,1:14:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在干什么 那是警车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think you're doing? That's an official vehicle! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.69,1:14:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要鸣笛吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should we use the sirens?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.73,1:14:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们偷了警车当然要鸣笛啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you think we'd steal a police car and not use the sirens?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.27,1:14:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-你有驾照吗  -该死 好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you have a license? - Fuck, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.94,1:14:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你们干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.07,1:14:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那是警车 你们不能偷警车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a cop car! You can't steal a cop car!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.83,1:14:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是我们点的餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll be our food.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.75,1:14:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.00,1:14:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不是送餐电话 是找你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the food. It's for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.54,1:14:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.71,1:14:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,请问您是哪位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask who's calling, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.21,1:14:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他说是凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says it's the killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.01,1:14:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-你好  -你好 盖尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Hello, Gale.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.56,1:14:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我竟然没通过电话 真奇怪啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange that you and I have never spoken on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.06,1:14:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们早该通话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is long overdue.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.40,1:14:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.90,1:14:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,报警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.15,1:14:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜过了这么些年…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured after all these years...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.74,1:14:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,（萨曼莎卡彭特）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.07,1:14:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定想采访我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd want an interview.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.57,1:14:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对 你猜对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you figured right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.58,1:14:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你这次的动机是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's your motive this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.62,1:15:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你对电影不满意还是想保持知名度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You angry at the movies or you just trying to stay relevant?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.79,1:15:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想问你同样的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could ask you the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.00,1:15:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道过往的角色是可以除掉的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know the legacy characters are disposable now?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.63,1:15:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没人在乎上个世纪的主角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody cares about last century's heroes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.17,1:15:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-那你为什么还找我  -可以说是念旧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why bother with me at all? Call it nostalgia.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.59,1:15:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,或者你也许应该被惩罚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe you deserve to be punished
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.55,1:15:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,惩罚你利用别人的惨剧挣那么多钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for all that money you made off the misery of others.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.60,1:15:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这次应该让别人 靠报道你的死讯挣钱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's time someone made a buck reporting your death.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.52,1:15:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经是第十个想杀我的鬼面杀手了 你知道吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you're like the tenth guy to try this, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.77,1:15:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,另外剧透一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And spoiler alert,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.90,1:15:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,戴面具的蠢人在剧终时永远不会得逞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it never works out for the dipshit in the mask.
