Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.40,1:34:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.95,1:34:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,让大家都离开那里 萨曼莎 你们不安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get everyone out of there, Sam. You're not safe.
