Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.66,1:34:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说自从伍德小镇去年发生那些命案后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said Agent Reed's been on a downward spiral
