Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.83,1:34:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他们两个月前 因为她精神状态不稳定辞退了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They fired Kirby two months ago for being mentally unstable.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.96,1:34:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么  -她已经不是FBI探员了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? She's no longer with the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.48,1:34:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-听着 浑蛋 -不 是你听着 小贱人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, asshole. No, you listen, you little bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.98,1:34:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢挂我的电话 我就像杀鱼一样剖了你 明白吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang up on me, I'll gut you like a fish. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.73,1:34:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-你想怎么样  -看看你里面长什么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want? To see what your insides look like.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.91,1:35:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.62,1:35:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,别人最近一次用这个地方是什么时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When was the last time anybody used this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.13,1:35:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这里好老旧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so old.
