Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.05,1:35:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-你拿 -不 我的意思是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take them. - No, I mean...
