Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.76,1:35:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-你觉得我想要这个  -也许吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think I want these? - Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.14,1:35:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,它们已经有一百岁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're a hundred years old.
