Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.63,1:35:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该早点吻我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you should've done that a lot sooner.
