Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.96,1:36:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你还可以多多吻我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you could also do it a lot more times.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.72,1:36:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,塔拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tara!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.31,1:36:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,塔拉 我们走 快 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tara, let's go. Come on, come on!
