Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.44,1:36:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-是可碧 她是凶手 -天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Kirby. She's the killer. No shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.24,1:36:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-被锁起来了 这边 -我们被困了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's locked. Come on. - Are we trapped?
