Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.87,1:36:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,也许能通往屋顶或别的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it leads to the roof or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.46,1:36:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要弄清楚只有一个办法 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one way to find out. Let's go.
