Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.21,1:36:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.38,1:36:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,砍头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beheadings!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.26,1:36:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,塔拉 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tara! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.97,1:36:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,看镜头笑一个 浑蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smile for the camera, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.35,1:36:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这边 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.52,1:36:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她应该从前门跑出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She should be running out the front door.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.57,1:37:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get fucked!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.59,1:37:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,塔拉 走 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tara, go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.97,1:37:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.89,1:37:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,查德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chad!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.23,1:37:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.52,1:37:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,走啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.20,1:37:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.87,1:37:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-这边 上这里 快 -韦斯卡彭特执导的电影一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way. Up here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.12,1:38:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.42,1:38:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都有嫌疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody's a suspect.
