Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.39,1:38:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没有动机时才更可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a lot scarier when there's no motive.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.10,1:38:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.14,1:38:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你要准备好 准备好了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to be ready. Ready?
