Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.61,1:38:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.02,1:38:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 浑蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.03,1:38:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.78,1:38:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-离我们远点 -我们知道凶手是你 可碧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay the fuck back! - We know it's you, Kirby.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.62,1:38:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有个凶手把我打晕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them knocked me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.45,1:38:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可碧 站住 离这两个姑娘远点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirby, stop! Get away from the girls!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.12,1:38:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.38,1:38:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是杀了奎茵  你是不是杀了我女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you kill Quinn? Did you kill my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.84,1:38:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,一派胡言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.42,1:38:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不管他跟你们说过什么 都不要相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever he's been saying to you, don't listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.51,1:38:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能就是凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's probably the killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.05,1:38:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你后面有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.02,1:39:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great job.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.90,1:39:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,都干得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.74,1:39:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-是你  -对 当然是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You? - Yeah, of course me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.08,1:39:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说 你们对我们做了那种事 我以为你们很厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankly, I expected more from the two of you after what you did to us.
