Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.97,1:39:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,为了接近你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I had to do to meet you
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.47,1:39:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我只需要跟自大又自负的查德当室友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was room with a conceited, condescending alpha literally named Chad.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.81,1:39:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 杀死他的感觉真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck, it felt good to kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.94,1:39:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你奶奶的 萨曼莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was your grandmother's, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.61,1:39:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,南希卢米斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy Loomis?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.19,1:39:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们家的人 流淌着连环杀手的血液 对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really runs in your fucking family, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.94,1:39:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-说到家人… -听好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking of family... Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.78,1:39:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不叫伊森兰德里…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...my name's not Ethan Landry,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.82,1:39:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is it, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.32,1:39:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,“爸爸”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dad"?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.12,1:40:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 如果你们是凶手 那剩下的这个…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. If it's you two, that just leaves...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.37,1:40:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是明迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mindy?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.22,1:40:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 室友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, roomies.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.05,1:40:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没想到吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't see that one coming, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.72,1:40:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-对 因为你死了 -其实并没死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, because you died! - Kind of didn't, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.31,1:40:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那是摆脱嫌疑的好办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a good way to get off the suspect list.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.94,1:40:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,让我可以毫无忌惮地捅盖尔威瑟斯 在地铁上捅明迪等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stab Gale Weathers, stab Mindy on the train. That sort of thing.
