Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.57,1:40:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就可以用新鲜的尸体把她换出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I could switch her body out with a fresh one.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.40,1:40:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,用一些假血和一个假体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little fake blood, a prosthetic.
