Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.54,1:40:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我最喜欢的杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.50,1:40:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 这是第三个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice. That's number three.
